{"unit_id":"DEVVE-1__dsh-windows-approval-notify#card-zh","repo":"DEVVE-1/dsh-windows-approval-notify","commit":"f6080fd5451826c8e6dacbe8382600a565c1250a","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Windows Approval Notify（DSH 桌面插件）：在 Windows 上将 DSH 的审批请求和主会话成功完成事件转成系统 Toast。它监听 approval/request，并以 approval/asked 兜底；仅在 DSH 不处于前台时提醒。通知沿用审批原因或会话标题，忽略子代理及非成功结束状态。插件由常驻 PowerShell 宿主显示通知，异常退出时会尝试恢复。适合将 DSH 放在后台运行、需要留意审批或任务结束的 Windows 用户。需要 Windows 10/11 和系统自带的 powershell.exe。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:269-305","notify-host.ps1:32-57","foreground.ps1:22-31"]}
{"unit_id":"DEVVE-1__dsh-windows-approval-notify#card-en","repo":"DEVVE-1/dsh-windows-approval-notify","commit":"f6080fd5451826c8e6dacbe8382600a565c1250a","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Windows Approval Notify sends Windows toast alerts for DSH approval requests and completed main sessions. It suppresses alerts while DSH is in the foreground and uses a persistent PowerShell host. For Windows users running DSH in the background; requires Windows 10/11 and powershell.exe.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:269-305","notify-host.ps1:32-57","foreground.ps1:22-31"]}
