{"unit_id":"DEVVE-1__dsh-windows-approval-notify#feature-1","repo":"DEVVE-1/dsh-windows-approval-notify","commit":"f6080fd5451826c8e6dacbe8382600a565c1250a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Windows Approval Notify 的功能「审批请求提醒」：收到 DSH 授权请求时显示 Windows Toast，并在主事件未捕获时使用 approval/asked 事件兜底。通知显示 DSH 提供的原因文本。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:273-282","index.js:295-304","notify-host.ps1:45-57"]}
{"unit_id":"DEVVE-1__dsh-windows-approval-notify#feature-2","repo":"DEVVE-1/dsh-windows-approval-notify","commit":"f6080fd5451826c8e6dacbe8382600a565c1250a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Windows Approval Notify 的功能「完成状态提醒」：主会话的 turn/end 原因为 completed 时发送 Windows 通知；子代理会话以及其他结束原因不触发提醒。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:214-220","index.js:284-293"]}
{"unit_id":"DEVVE-1__dsh-windows-approval-notify#feature-3","repo":"DEVVE-1/dsh-windows-approval-notify","commit":"f6080fd5451826c8e6dacbe8382600a565c1250a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Windows Approval Notify 的功能「前台抑制」：通知宿主检查当前窗口标题；标题含 DeepSeek Harness 时跳过 Toast，让用户正在查看 DSH 时不重复弹出提醒。","source":"generated","evidence":["foreground.ps1:22-31","notify-host.ps1:37-43"]}
{"unit_id":"DEVVE-1__dsh-windows-approval-notify#feature-4","repo":"DEVVE-1/dsh-windows-approval-notify","commit":"f6080fd5451826c8e6dacbe8382600a565c1250a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Windows Approval Notify 的功能「通知宿主恢复」：插件激活时启动常驻 PowerShell 通道；写入待发通知，宿主失败时尝试一次性发送并按退避间隔重启。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:43-58","index.js:86-139"]}
{"unit_id":"DEVVE-1__dsh-windows-approval-notify#caveat-1","repo":"DEVVE-1/dsh-windows-approval-notify","commit":"f6080fd5451826c8e6dacbe8382600a565c1250a","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Windows Approval Notify 仅在 Windows 上启用通知逻辑，并依赖 powershell.exe；插件在其他平台直接返回。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:222-224","index.js:16-26"]}
{"unit_id":"DEVVE-1__dsh-windows-approval-notify#caveat-2","repo":"DEVVE-1/dsh-windows-approval-notify","commit":"f6080fd5451826c8e6dacbe8382600a565c1250a","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Windows Approval Notify 在前台窗口标题匹配 DeepSeek Harness 时会抑制提醒；它只通知成功完成的主会话，不提示子代理或其他结束状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:30-31","index.js:284-293","foreground.ps1:22-31"]}
